{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46873","headline":"渚宫谢杨秀才自嵩山相访 · 齐己","name":"渚宫谢杨秀才自嵩山相访","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嵩峰有客远相寻，尘满麻衣袖苦吟。\n花尽草长方闭户，道孤身老正伤心。\n红堆落日云千仞，碧撼凉风竹一林。\n惆怅雅声消歇去，喜君聊此暂披襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46873.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46873","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}